invalid.vue:3:26 lint/nursery/noVueDeprecatedVOnNativeModifier ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × The .native modifier on v-on is deprecated.
  
    1 │ <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
    2 │ <template>
  > 3 │   <MyComponent v-on:click.native="onClick" />
      │                          ^^^^^^^
    4 │   <MyComponent @click.native="onClick" />
    5 │   <input v-on:keyup.native="fire">
  
  i Vue 3 removed this modifier. Listeners for events that a component does not declare in its emits option are added to its root element automatically.
  
  i Remove the .native modifier.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

